t","label":"ggz151dBcWS_text","default":"<p>Linda K.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggecgzMTTRp_text","label":"ggecgzMTTRp_text","default":"Karen M.⁩"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXzHT75I_F_text","label":"ggXzHT75I_F_text","default":"<p>I've been using this product for a month. It's expensive, but worth it. Shilajit resin was recommended for natural energy and focus. Other supplements either don't work for me or disrupt my sleep. Despite my doubts, I chose the purest, most highly rated brand and I'm glad I did. It took some time, but I noticed sustained energy and focus throughout the day. Unlike other supplements, this one doesn't fall flat midday. Even after a month, I haven't experienced diminishing returns. I'll continue using this effective product!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnc3vESAWh_text","label":"ggnc3vESAWh_text","default":"Brian L."},{"type":"html","id":"ggNGcANvfIe_text","label":"ggNGcANvfIe_text","default":"<p>I've been taking this supplement for two weeks, and the results are excellent. I no longer feel sluggish or need caffeine for energy. Instead, I feel relaxed, stress-free, and energetic, waking up ready to go. I measure my serving with the included spoon, let it dissolve in my mouth, and then swallow it with water. The taste is earthy, but it doesn't bother me. I had blood work done before starting the supplement and will compare results after a month. Based on my experience, I recommend this product for a natural energy boost. After a month, my testosterone levels increased from 152 to 438. I feel focused, stress-free, and energized. The product has worked wonders for me, and I stand by my purchase.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2oATCA8UC_text","label":"gg2oATCA8UC_text","default":"Kelly F."},{"type":"html","id":"ggCoNNWF5Lg_text","label":"ggCoNNWF5Lg_text","default":"<p>For the last 10 years, I've focused on eating only natural foods—no dairy, grains, processed, or fast foods. Recently, I added supplements to my regimen, and shilajit has become a staple. I take it in the morning with my Matcha tea, turmeric, mushroom blend, flaxseed oil, and sea moss with burdock root and bladderwrack.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Shilajit has been worth the investment, even though it's one of the pricier options. I noticed a difference within four or five days of my morning and night routine. I don't feel sluggish or need caffeine for energy. Instead, I feel relaxed, stress-free, and energetic, waking up ready to go. I use the included spoon to measure my serving, let the resin dissolve in my mouth, and then swallow it with water. The taste is very earthy, like placing a rock or dirt in your mouth, but it's worth it!</p>"}],
